  ┃ G End            last entry                     d      move to Trash                         ┃
  ┃ → l Enter        open directory                 D      delete permanently (type delete)      ┃
  ┃ ← h Backspace <  parent directory                                                            ┃
  ┃                                                 Panels                                       ┃
  ┃ Sort                                            /         filter this directory              ┃
  ┃ s  sort by size (again: reverse)                i         details of the selected entry      ┃
  ┃ n  sort by name (again: reverse)                Tab       move focus between the list and    ┃
  ┃ C  sort by items (again: reverse)                         the details                        ┃
  ┃ M  sort by modification time (again:            !         list what could not be read, and   ┃
  ┃    reverse)                                               go to it                           ┃
  ┃ S  re-sort now                                  ? F1      keys                               ┃
  ┃                                                 : Ctrl-P  command palette                    ┃
