  ┃ 1  list view                                                                                 ┃
  ┃ 2  treemap view                                 Global                                       ┃
  ┃ +  treemap: one level deeper                    Esc       close the overlay, or clear the    ┃
  ┃ -  treemap: one level less                                filter                             ┃
  ┃ p  treemap: colour by top folder or age         q Ctrl-C  quit                               ┃
  ┃ a  toggle apparent size / disk usage                                                         ┃
